{"asset_key":"mn3/quest_story_11212200","episode":"mn3","category":"quest_story","story_id":"11212200","schema_version":1,"lang":"cn","texts":{"say:1:1121220001:0":{"text":"放开我……我能自己走！","source_cn":"放开我……我能自己走！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x09470B81645980C1","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1121220002:0":{"text":"姑娘，要不是你一路上好几次想要逃跑，我也不至于这么对你。","source_cn":"姑娘，要不是你一路上好几次想要逃跑，我也不至于这么对你。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD59F7F7B3FDC8C13","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1121220003:0":{"text":"维伦，你们回来了，看样子有所收获。","source_cn":"维伦，你们回来了，看样子有所收获。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xCF4077DB083CC6D8","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1121220004:1":{"text":"将军，你一定想不到，我们抓住了黑金女士的女儿。","source_cn":"将军，你一定想不到，我们抓住了黑金女士的女儿。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5947800B7B8F5561","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1121220005:2":{"text":"什么！","source_cn":"什么！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x651734008AA80CB6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1121220006:1":{"text":"准确来说……她自称是黑金女士的女儿，